{"text":"永熙二年九月十日，佛弟子陵江將軍段桃樹敬造無量壽像一區。父母、眷屬、一切衆生，離苦得洛，値遇諸佛。","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"陵江將軍","refId":null,"text":"陵江將軍","start":12,"end":16},{"name":"PersonName","term":"段桃樹","refId":null,"text":"段桃樹","start":16,"end":19},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量壽","refId":null,"text":"無量壽","start":21,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":36,"end":38},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"離苦","refId":null,"text":"離苦","start":39,"end":41}]}